WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:01.168
[Colt] I'm going crazy.

00:00:01.251 --> 00:00:03.045
Abby, she left me.

00:00:03.128 --> 00:00:04.338
Don't want to see my dad.

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:05.631
I partnered up
with my cousin.

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:06.924
Couple weeks ago, he run off

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:08.217
with Rooster's ex
and all the money.

00:00:08.759 --> 00:00:09.843
God.

00:00:09.927 --> 00:00:11.512
Your life blows.

00:00:12.137 --> 00:00:13.055
Yup.

00:00:13.472 --> 00:00:14.806
[Lisa] You know
I like you, Colt.

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:16.308
But the fact is,
we're competitors.

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:18.977
So if you do go under,
it'll be good for me.

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:20.896
[Colt] I just want you
to know that

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:22.189
I'm a good father, husband.

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:25.400
I got one of them
stick figure family decals.

00:00:25.484 --> 00:00:26.985
Stick figure daddy Colt

00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:28.987
is giving stick figure
mommy Abby space,

00:00:29.071 --> 00:00:30.405
just like she asked for.

00:00:31.073 --> 00:00:32.658
That kid can't catch a break.

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:34.076
Come on,
it's the middle of the night.

00:00:34.159 --> 00:00:35.077
[Heather] Are you drunk?

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.870
-No.
-Oh, my...

00:00:36.954 --> 00:00:37.788
Yeah.

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:40.374
[Colt] How am I
supposed to survive?

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:42.125
What if I was
your ranch hand?

00:00:42.209 --> 00:00:44.002
Ain't no way
you're taking orders from me.

00:00:44.086 --> 00:00:45.671
Hell, you can't even follow
the directions

00:00:45.754 --> 00:00:47.047
on the back of a TV dinner.

00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:49.841
You wanna stick around,
watch some football?

00:00:49.925 --> 00:00:52.761
I would, but I already have
a school thing.

00:00:52.844 --> 00:00:54.429
[making alarm sound]

00:00:54.513 --> 00:00:55.347
[laughs]

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:56.723
Nerd alert, right, Dad?

00:00:57.641 --> 00:00:58.725
Whoop, whoop!

00:00:58.809 --> 00:01:00.269
Shut the... [beep] ...up.

00:01:02.271 --> 00:01:03.647
[vocalizing]

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:08.402
♪ Gotta get up&nbsp;♪

00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:10.779
♪ Away from here&nbsp;♪

00:01:10.862 --> 00:01:12.114
Morning, boys.

00:01:12.197 --> 00:01:14.032
-Beautiful day.
-Is this a trap?

00:01:14.658 --> 00:01:16.743
If I say yes, you gonna
call me a... [beep] ...idiot?

00:01:16.827 --> 00:01:18.370
No, I'm in a good mood.

00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:19.997
Huh? Tell your face.

